 "description": "The newest pump.fun tokens with dev buy, early buyers/volume, curve progress, market cap and creator launch count. Returns up to 50 of the most recent launches (seconds old) with the first-N-seconds flow already aggregated, so an agent can shortlist without replaying the chain. When to use: To discover new mints; then use launch_scan for a verdict on one of them. Price: $0.002 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
